        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "NOTIFICATION UNDER ARTICLE 12.1(A) OF THE AGREEMENT ON SAFEGUARDS ON INITIATION OF AN INVESTIGATION AND THE REASONS FOR IT"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                220,
                252,
                776,
                293
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "UNITED STATES"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                443,
                307,
                552,
                321
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Lamb Meat"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                453,
                340,
                546,
                356
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The following communication, dated and received on 17 July 2026, is being circulated at the request of the delegation of the United States."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                375,
                882,
                404
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Pursuant to Article 12.1(a) of the WTO Agreement on Safeguards (Safeguards Agreement), the United States notifies that a safeguard investigation has been initiated as follows:"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                453,
                882,
                482
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. Specify the date when the investigation was initiated"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                494,
                623,
                509
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The U.S. International Trade Commission (Commission) initiated the investigation on 13 July 2026."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                521,
                878,
                536
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "A copy of the notice of institution of the investigation, which includes the scheduling of public hearings and the applicable rules of procedure, is attached.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "^{1}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                548,
                882,
                577
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The Commission has determined that this investigation is \"extraordinarily complicated\" within the meaning of 19 U.S.C. § 2252(b)(2)(B)) and will make its serious injury determination by 13 November 2026. If the Commission's determination is affirmative, or the Commission is equally divided, the Commission will submit its report to the President within 180 days of the date on which the petition was properly filed, 9 January 2027."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                112,
                587,
                882,
                657
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2. Specify the product subject to the investigation"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                667,
                574,
                682
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The product covered by this investigation is fresh, chilled, or frozen lamb meat. Excluded from the scope are imports of live lambs and sheep and meat of mature sheep (mutton). Imports of lamb meat may enter under the following subheadings of the Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS): 0204.10.00, 0204.21.00, 0204.22.20, 0204.22.40, 0204.23.20, 0204.23.40, 0204.30.00, 0204.41.00, 0204.42.20, 0204.42.40, 0204.43.20, and 0204.43.40. While these HTSUS subheadings are provided for convenience and U.S. Customs purposes, the written description of the scope above is dispositive."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                112,
                695,
                882,
                790
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                54,
                221,
                123
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "WORLD TRADE\nORGANIZATION"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                231,
                70,
                442,
                108
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_header",
            "content": {
                "page_header_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "G/SG/N/6/USA/16"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                699,
                68,
                872,
                84
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "^{1}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  A copy of the notice of institution of the investigation has also been submitted electronically and is available to government representatives. To consult it, please contact Ms Anne Richards of the Rules Division (anne.richards@wto.org)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                878,
                863,
                915
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3. Provide the reasons for the initiation of the investigation"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                99,
                655,
                114
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(i) Was the investigation initiated pursuant to a petition from the domestic industry?"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                127,
                791,
                142
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "No, the investigation is being initiated, pursuant to 19 U.S.C. § 2252, in response to a request filed on 13 July 2026, by the United States Trade Representative."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                155,
                880,
                182
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(ii) Evidence on the basis of which the investigation was initiated."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                194,
                642,
                209
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Increased Import Quantities"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                222,
                337,
                237
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The request from the United States Trade Representative alleges that U.S. import statistics indicate that lamb meat imports, which are sourced in major quantities from multiple countries, have increased in recent years."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                249,
                882,
                290
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Serious Injury or Threat of Serious Injury to the Domestic Industry"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                302,
                636,
                317
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The request further alleges that available information suggests that these imports resulted in domestic industry lost sales, revenue, and market share as imported lamb meat significantly undersold the domestic like product. Moreover, recent information suggests that firms have exited the domestic industry entirely, and there have been domestic industry job losses, decreased capacity utilization rates, and struggles to maintain profitability."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                328,
                882,
                397
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Unforeseen Developments"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                409,
                322,
                423
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The request does not make reference to unforeseen developments; however, the request states that the United States Trade Representative may request at a later date that the Commission identify any unforeseen developments and the effect of the obligations incurred under the WTO Agreement that led to such product being imported into the United States in such increased quantities as to be a substantial cause of serious injury, or the threat thereof, to the domestic industry."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                435,
                882,
                504
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The information contained in the request can be found at https://edis.usitc.gov."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                515,
                732,
                530
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(iii) Evidence, if any, of critical circumstances where delay would could damage which it would be difficult to repair."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                542,
                880,
                570
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The request did not allege critical circumstances."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                583,
                495,
                598
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4. Provide a point of contact for the investigation and identify the preferred means for corresponding."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                114,
                610,
                880,
                638
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The point of contact for the investigation is:"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                115,
                650,
                455,
                665
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Camille Bryan"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                676,
                277,
                691
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
